+ *    1.0.2a-b                      10003  version, except as noted.
+ *    1.0.3                         10003
+ *    1.0.3a-d                      10004
+ *    1.0.4                         10004
+ *    1.0.4a-f                      10005
+ *    1.0.5 (+ 2 patches)           10005
+ *    1.0.5a-d                      10006
+ *    1.0.5e-r                      10100 (not source compatible)
